    <entry>
        <title>Widening Circles</title>
        <author>
            <name>Jujube</name>
        </author>
        <link href="https://www.jujubemonster.com/widening-circles.html"/>
        <id>https://www.jujubemonster.com/widening-circles.html</id>
        <media:content url="https://www.jujubemonster.com/media/posts/121/nosleep-2.png" medium="image" />
            <category term="poetry"/>

        <updated>2026-08-08T10:19:17-07:00</updated>
            <summary type="html">
                <![CDATA[
                        <img src="https://www.jujubemonster.com/media/posts/121/nosleep-2.png" alt="" />
                    I live my life in widening circles that reach out across the world. I may not complete this last one, but I give myself to it. I have been circling around God, around the ancient tower, and I have been circling for a thousand years.
                ]]>
            </summary>
        <content type="html">
            <![CDATA[
                    <p><img src="https://www.jujubemonster.com/media/posts/121/nosleep-2.png" class="type:primaryImage" alt="" /></p>
                <div class="" data-block="true" data-editor="795s6" data-offset-key="bv5v0-0-0">
<div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="bv5v0-0-0"><span data-offset-key="bv5v0-0-0">I live my life in widening circles</span></div>
</div>
<div class="" data-block="true" data-editor="795s6" data-offset-key="2j499-0-0">
<div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="2j499-0-0"><span data-offset-key="2j499-0-0">that reach out across the world.</span></div>
</div>
<div class="" data-block="true" data-editor="795s6" data-offset-key="chd30-0-0">
<div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="chd30-0-0"><span data-offset-key="chd30-0-0">I may not complete this last one,</span></div>
</div>
<div class="" data-block="true" data-editor="795s6" data-offset-key="5rrsv-0-0">
<div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="5rrsv-0-0"><span data-offset-key="5rrsv-0-0">but I give myself to it.</span></div>
</div>
<div class="" data-block="true" data-editor="795s6" data-offset-key="fbu9s-0-0">
<div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="fbu9s-0-0"><span data-offset-key="fbu9s-0-0">I have been circling around God, around the ancient tower,</span></div>
</div>
<div class="" data-block="true" data-editor="795s6" data-offset-key="doejr-0-0">
<div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="doejr-0-0"><span data-offset-key="doejr-0-0">and I have been circling for a thousand years.</span></div>
</div>
<div class="" data-block="true" data-editor="795s6" data-offset-key="b092m-0-0">
<div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="b092m-0-0"><span data-offset-key="b092m-0-0">And I still don't know:</span></div>
</div>
<div class="" data-block="true" data-editor="795s6" data-offset-key="31ds2-0-0">
<div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="31ds2-0-0"><span data-offset-key="31ds2-0-0">am I a falcon, a storm, or a great song?</span></div>
<div data-offset-key="31ds2-0-0">-- Rainer Maria Rilke</div>
<div data-offset-key="31ds2-0-0"> </div>
<div data-offset-key="31ds2-0-0"><figure class="post__image"><img loading="lazy"  src="https://www.jujubemonster.com/media/posts/121/nosleep.png" alt="" width="500" height="664"></figure></div>
</div>
            ]]>
        </content>
    </entry>
